&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;D&amp;ouml;n&amp;uuml;p T&amp;Uuml;İK&amp;rsquo;e bakıyorsunuz, gen&amp;ccedil;lerimizin b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k bir kısmı hem mutluymuş, hemde işinden ve gelirinden memnunmuş. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

